    signs: ['Breathlessness, especially on exertion', 'Persistent cough with mucus', 'Wheezing', 'Frequent chest infections', 'Tiredness'],
    better: ['Diagnosed with spirometry', 'Stopping smoking is the most effective treatment', 'Inhalers to open the airways', 'Pulmonary rehabilitation and, for some, oxygen therapy'],
